[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12061.309, "timestamp": "03:21:01", "text": "哦，其实我也能做到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12063.95, "timestamp": "03:21:03", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12067.59, "timestamp": "03:21:07", "text": "嗯，我觉得我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12070.79, "timestamp": "03:21:10", "text": "之后利用肾上腺素的刺激去偷你的东西，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12072.95, "timestamp": "03:21:12", "text": "等等，你可以偷我的东西？ 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12074.229, "timestamp": "03:21:14", "text": "我刚才就是这么做的。 我偷了你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12076.63, "timestamp": "03:21:16", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12080.07, "timestamp": "03:21:20", "text": "我的天啊。 然后我挡住了你的回合。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12084.07, "timestamp": "03:21:24", "text": "真是糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12085.95, "timestamp": "03:21:25", "text": "对不起，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12091.03, "timestamp": "03:21:31", "text": "乔布先生。 嗯，这里留了一个空白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12094.15, "timestamp": "03:21:34", "text": "现在轮到你了。 前进。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12097.429, "timestamp": "03:21:37", "text": "我不能偷你的东西。 好的。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12099.349, "timestamp": "03:21:39", "text": "可以。 哦，如果有一种叫做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12101.63, "timestamp": "03:21:41", "text": "肾上腺素的物品，装备上它就可以偷到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12105.99, "timestamp": "03:21:45", "text": "物品了。 好吧，伙计。 邦克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12109.19, "timestamp": "03:21:49", "text": "哇。 好吧，我打算开枪打死你，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12111.91, "timestamp": "03:21:51", "text": "因为这极有可能发生。 没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12113.99, "timestamp": "03:21:53", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12116.55, "timestamp": "03:21:56", "text": "我想我们现在地位平等了。 太"}]